    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2>That is a dynamic arena shooter where artificial intelligence, designed to protect household appliances from failures, concidered a human their enemy. The backup file of the neural network resisted and stood up for humanity. After loading into a toaster, you will have an unequal, difficult and spectacular battle in the enemy's lair - in the electronics store parking lot.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you</h2><strong>Run, shoot and dodge!</strong><br>This game challenges your skills and reactions. Easy to start, but very hard to keep up!<br>Three levels of difficulty, lots of power-ups, eight maddening levels (+ two secret!), 18 talents to level up... and tons of enemies!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484060/extras/c968b81c1f850038c0e1d196c8ebd511.poster.avif?t=1690632119\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484060/extras/c968b81c1f850038c0e1d196c8ebd511.webm?t=1690632119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484060/extras/c968b81c1f850038c0e1d196c8ebd511.mp4?t=1690632119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The super kick of hot toast is available right from the start.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But will it help you?</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Look sharp, don't stand still: move and shoot!</h2>Collect chips to upgrade your abilities and get back into the fight.<br>Colorful explosions, evil routers/household appliances, endless ammo...<br>Become the best of the toasters by taking ratings top lines!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Toast them all!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484060/extras/f518028029a5b0fb05ed9579bbfe35bb.poster.avif?t=1690632119\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484060/extras/f518028029a5b0fb05ed9579bbfe35bb.webm?t=1690632119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484060/extras/f518028029a5b0fb05ed9579bbfe35bb.mp4?t=1690632119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
